---
import { socialImpactStats } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<section id="caritas" class="w-full bg-surface-container py-20 border-t border-surface-container">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Mission, Story & Initiatives (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Cáritas y Pastoral Social Parroquial</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-charcoal font-bold leading-tight">
          "La fe sin obras está muerta": El amor hecho servicio real a los hermanos
        </h2>

        <p class="text-charcoal-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
          Nuestra comunidad sostiene una red permanente de auxilio alimentario, ropa, refuerzo escolar infantil y escucha terapéutica para más de 180 familias en situación de vulnerabilidad en nuestra feligresía. Todo gracias a la generosidad desinteresada de los voluntarios.
        </p>

        <!-- Initiatives Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal block">Banco de Alimentos</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted leading-snug">Entrega quincenal de canastas con víveres e higiene personal.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gold/15 text-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal block">Ropero Solidario</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted leading-snug">Selección digna de abrigo, mantas y calzado infantil en buen estado.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-navy/10 text-navy flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal block">Apoyo Escolar a la Infancia</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted leading-snug">Tardes de refuerzo educativo y merienda dirigida por maestros voluntarios.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal block">Acompañamiento a Mayores</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted leading-snug">Visitas y llamadas semanales de fraternidad para abuelos que viven solos.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a href="#contacto" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-hover text-xs font-bold transition-colors shadow-sm">
            Ser Voluntario en Cáritas
          </a>
          <a href="#donaciones" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md bg-white text-charcoal hover:bg-surface-container-high text-xs font-bold transition-colors border border-surface-container">
            Donar Alimentos o Ropa
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Live Metrics Card & Testimonial (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-sacred border border-surface-container flex flex-col gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-primary">
              Impacto de Caridad Comunitario
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-light">Memoria Anual</span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">{socialImpactStats.families}</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-0.5">Familias atendidas mes a mes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">{socialImpactStats.foodTons}</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-0.5">Kilos de alimentos repartidos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">{socialImpactStats.volunteers}</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-0.5">Voluntarios laicos activos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">{socialImpactStats.childrenTutored}</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted mt-0.5">Niños con refuerzo escolar diario</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Progress Bar -->
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl flex flex-col gap-2 border border-surface-container">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-charcoal">{socialImpactStats.campaignTitle}</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-primary">{socialImpactStats.campaignProgress}%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden">
              <div class="bg-primary h-2.5 rounded-full" style={`width: ${socialImpactStats.campaignProgress}%`}></div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-charcoal-light">{socialImpactStats.campaignGoal}</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Parish Testimonial -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex items-start gap-4">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-muted italic leading-relaxed">
              "En esta parroquia no solo encontré una bolsa de víveres en los meses más duros, encontré una familia que me escuchó con infinito respeto y me devolvió la dignidad."
            </p>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-charcoal mt-2">— Carmen R., vecina de la feligresía</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
